+"""Version- and device-qualified I3C declarations; no generic CAN rate or packet."""
+MIPI='https://www.mipi.org/resources/I3C-frequently-asked-questions'
+NXP='https://mcuxpresso.nxp.com/api_doc/dev/3802/a00037.html'
